msgid "Toolbars"
msgstr "工具栏"

#: ../../source/users/interface/toolbars.rst:8
msgid ""
"In addition to the different `menus`_, QElectroTech also provides toolbars. "
"The toolbars are groups of buttons with icons which initiate actions. In "
"general, these buttons have its counterpart at one of the menus from the "
"`menu bar`_."
msgstr ""
"除了不同的 `菜单 <menus_>`_ 之外，QElectroTech 还提供工具栏。工具栏是带图标的按钮组，用于启动相应操作。通常这些按钮在 "
"`菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 的某个菜单中都有对应项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/toolbars.rst:14
msgid ""
"To help the user, a tooltip is displayed when the arrow is placed on each "
"button."
